  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hfu - University of Ghana Ocean Governance Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build and strengthen knowledge on ocean governance and law of the sea in Ghana. The project will entail the development and delivery of a variety of customized and needs-based capacity-building programmes for ODA countries, primarily the delivery of regional or national training workshops on the implementation of the UNCLOS framework, the 2030 Agenda and its SDGs, ocean-based economies (&#x201C;blue economy&#x201D;), as well as the conduct of gap analyses of legal frameworks for ocean governance at the national level.</narrative>
  </description>
